# Documentation-first showcase: ignore everything except explicitly reviewed files.
# This is a guardrail, not a secret scanner. Forced additions can bypass it.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/TESTING.md
!assets/
assets/*
!assets/app-icon.png
!assets/screenshots/
assets/screenshots/*
!assets/screenshots/san-francisco-race.png
!assets/screenshots/race-strategy.png
!assets/screenshots/trichy-circuit.png
